<title>POLAND: NEW CARGO TERMINAL OPENED AT POLISH AIRPORT.</title>
<headline>NEW CARGO TERMINAL OPENED AT POLISH AIRPORT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A company managing the small international Pyrzowice airport near the southern city of Krakow on Tuesday opened a new cargo terminal there, PAP news agency said.</p>
<p>PAP quoted the company's president Marek Mutke as saying the new terminal, with the storage area of 665 square metres, was needed after the cargo volume at Pyrzowice increased by 65 percent last year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
